  message: "SATISFIED at dev 399aa5a3f3 (PR #361). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE, the item's own filed\nrepro re-run on the MERGED tree:\n\n  FILED (violated): adding\n      io_primitives: [io-primitives-overlays/hypergumbo-self.yaml]   (language: python)\n  to docs/hypergumbo.claims.yaml aborted with\n      IoPrimitiveOverlayError: ... declares language 'python' but was loaded\n      for 'javascript'. Applying it would attribute I/O to the wrong tree.\n\n  MERGED (satisfied): the same claims file loads, the overlay is applied to\n  python only, and `verify-claims . --claims docs/hypergumbo.claims.yaml`\n  completes and prints \"Loaded 1 project-local I/O primitive overlay(s)\".\n  Measured effect of the overlay actually applying: uncatalogued modules\n  137 -> 102.\n\nTHE FIX DISCRIMINATES RATHER THAN SOFTENS, which was the requirement written\ninto this item's own description:\n  - an overlay for ANOTHER SHIPPED language is SKIPPED - being asked about a\n    language you do not describe is a question, not an error;\n  - an overlay for a language no catalogue knows (`language: pyton`) still\n    RAISES, because silently ignoring a typo leaves the author believing their\n    rows applied, which is the fail-quiet direction.\nBoth arms are pinned:\n  test_an_overlay_for_ANOTHER_shipped_language_is_skipped\n  test_an_overlay_for_an_UNKNOWN_language_is_still_refused\nand the skip arm additionally asserts the go rows did NOT leak into python and\nthat python's own rows survived, so it cannot pass by the merge becoming a\nno-op.\n\nONE RULE, ONE HOME: the language->catalogue resolution (direct file, then\n_CATALOG_ALIASES) was inline in load_catalog and is now _catalog_path_for,\nconsumed by both callers. A second inline copy would have got `typescript`\nwrong, since it resolves through the alias table rather than a file of its own.\n\nCOLLATERAL WORTH NAMING: this also unblocks declaring the two overlays already\nshipped under docs/io-primitives-overlays/ (python-http-clients + go-web-\nframeworks) TOGETHER, which is the obvious thing a polyglot repo does and was\nimpossible before.\n\nSuite 22,884 passed / 7 skipped / 17 xfailed (= 22,908 ingested) / 100% / core\ngreen in isolation / mypy ratchet clean."  # c987
